<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31312" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσβῐβάζω</span></b> , causal of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσβαίνω,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>put on board ship,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν στρατὸν [ἐς τὰς νέας</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.95
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.60
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ξένους καὶ τοὺς
				δούλους ναύτας εἰ.</span>
			<i>impress</i> them, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				8.48
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>make to go into,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὸ περιοικοδομημένον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.60
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς ἅρμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.60
				</span></i>
			.</div>
